  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "**Must be at least 25 years of age to rent this property.<br><br>This property is located in Sandestin® Golf and Beach Resort. *<br>1327 Ravens Run at Laurel Grove<br>Brand new 6-seat GOLF CART included with rental!<br><br>Charming lakeside 3BR-3BA coastal cottage that sleeps 8 guests! 1327 Ravens Run is situated in the picturesque enclave of Laurel Grove at the Resort. Our location is convenient to the beach entrance, the Village at Baytowne Wharf, the marina, tennis center, and all that the Resort has to offer. The Laurel Grove clubhouse features a sparkling blue swimming pool (seasonally heated), hot tub, an exercise room and a full kitchen with an outdoor grilling area. There are several ponds at Laurel Grove suitable for catch and release fishing. A quick tram ride will take you straight to the beautiful sandy white beach. The Resort also offers tennis, golf, restaurants, shopping, walking trails, bicycle paths, and activities too numerous to list!<br><br>Tastefully furnished with comfort in mind, the updated décor reflects casual beach style. Our spacious family room is designed with a 30” cathedral ceiling, wood floors, cushy seating, and a large HDTV/DVD. French doors open to a breezy lakeside porch with outdoor seating. Enjoy preparing meals for everyone in our fully stocked updated kitchen. The patios both have seating for enjoying time outside. <br><br>The master bedroom is conveniently located on the main floor and offers a king bed, an HDTV, and adjoins the master bathroom with a soaking tub and separate shower. Also located on the main floor is the second bedroom with a Queen bed, an HDTV and a hallway guest bathroom featuring a large shower. The upstairs bedroom offers 2 Queen beds (not twins), an HDTV, and a full bathroom with a tub/shower. There is a stacked washer and dryer, and wifi is complimentary.<br><br>Our cottage is a relaxing place to spend some time at the beach! Your vacation to remember starts here at 1312 Ravens Run E at Laurel Grove.<br><br>CANCELLATION: Reservations that are cancelled more than 30 days prior to the arrival date receive a full refund. Reservations cancelled 14-29 days prior to arrival receive a refund of 50% of the amount paid. Reservations cancelled within 14 days of arrival receive no refund unless the guest purchased travel insurance. Guests are required to complete a rental agreement by electronic signature within 3 days of booking.<br><br>NOTE: The total reservation cost includes the nightly rate, clean fee, damage waiver, transportation fee (for select properties), processing fee and tax. By requesting a quote for this property, you agree to be added to our email subscription list.<br><br>*Sandestin® is a registered trademark of Sandestin Investments, LLC and is used for location purposes only.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
